selectable-set-syndicate-spy-name = Spy Bundle
selectable-set-syndicate-spy-description = Complete your objectives quietly with this compilation of stealthy items. Contains chameleon gear, an agent ID, and a stealth box.

selectable-set-syndicate-hitman-name = Hitman Bundle
selectable-set-syndicate-hitman-description = Find and eliminate your targets quietly and effectively. Contains a Cobra pistol with spare mags, a CQC manual, and covert armor.

selectable-set-syndicate-implants-name = Cyberpsychosis Bundle
selectable-set-syndicate-implants-description = A few implants to give you options for when you inevitably get arrested. Contains a nutriment pump, scram, freedom, smoke and Krav Maga implants, plus two cybernetic autosurgeons.

selectable-set-syndicate-hacker-name = Hacker Bundle
selectable-set-syndicate-hacker-description = Everything you need to hack into and disrupt the station itself, its AI, its cyborgs and Security. HACK THE PLANET!

selectable-set-syndicate-desword-name = Dark Lord Bundle
selectable-set-syndicate-desword-description = Turn your anger into hate and your hate into suffering with this lightsaber. Contains a double-bladed energy sword and an armored cloak.

selectable-set-syndicate-grenadier-name = Grenadier Bundle
selectable-set-syndicate-grenadier-description = Some explosives to ensure you can blast your way through any situation. Contains a bomb suit and a grenade-filled belt and backpack.

selectable-set-syndicate-fluclear-name = Fluclear Operative Bundle
selectable-set-syndicate-fluclear-description = Declare your allegiance to the Syndicate with this bundle. Contains a C-20R SMG, an energy shield, a jetpack, and a full hardsuit bundle.

selectable-set-syndicate-friendship-name = Friendship Bundle
selectable-set-syndicate-friendship-description = Friendship is magic! Go find yourself some friends with this bundle. Contains a contractor baton, handcuffs, mind control implanters, and sniper rifles.

selectable-set-syndicate-carp-name = Carp Bundle
selectable-set-syndicate-carp-description = Grr! Rrrr! Grr... Grrow?! KOWABUNGA! Contains a Sleeping Carp scroll, ten dehydrated carp, and a carp hardsuit.

selectable-set-syndicate-western-name = Western Bundle
selectable-set-syndicate-western-description = Tip the hat and let the music play. Contains a cowboy outfit, a revolver with speedloaders, and combat medipens.

selectable-set-syndicate-sus-name = Suspicion Bundle
selectable-set-syndicate-sus-description = When the traitor is sus. The traitor is you, of course. Contains a contortionist jumpsuit, a betrayal knife, and a stealth hardsuit bundle.

selectable-set-syndicate-lawyer-name = Lawyer Bundle
selectable-set-syndicate-lawyer-description = Object! Contains a lawyer's outfit, legal paperwork, a chameleon backpack, and a concealed pistol.

selectable-set-syndicate-no-russian-name = No Russian Bundle
selectable-set-no-russian-description = Contains a dark suit, tactical webbing, and an L6 light machine gun.

selectable-set-syndicate-pirate-captain-name = Pirate Captain Bundle
selectable-set-syndicate-pirate-captain-description = Yarr! Contains a full pirate captain's outfit, a revolver, a pirate cannon with shot, and a cutlass.

selectable-set-syndicate-engineer-name = Engineer Bundle
selectable-set-syndicate-engineer-description = Contains electrical turrets, a toolbox, grenades, a power sink, and a matching outfit for the aspiring saboteur.

selectable-set-syndicate-door-kicker-name = Door Kicker Bundle
selectable-set-syndicate-door-kicker-description = Contains a SWAT-style outfit, a combat shotgun with shells, thermal goggles, and C-4.

selectable-set-syndicate-tunnel-clown-name = Tunnel Clown Bundle
selectable-set-syndicate-tunnel-clown-description = Nothing is funnier than 100 rubles. Contains a clown's outfit, a flaming fire axe, stun prods, and a bike horn.

selectable-set-sunset-medic-name = combat medic kit
selectable-set-sunset-medic-description = Combat medipens, a stimpack, a stimkit, a hypopen, and a bottle of nocturine to keep your team in the fight.

selectable-set-sunset-hotline-name = Hotline Miami costume
selectable-set-sunset-hotline-description = One random full animal costume set from Hotline Miami 2. Style over substance - but what style.
